		(descr "HCTL PM254-2-05-S-8.5; LCSC C3975150; 2x5 vertical SMD female socket, 2.54mm mating pitch and row spacing, nominal 8.5mm height, no locating posts. Body 5.00x13.20mm. Exact-part EasyEDA land pattern HDR-SMD_10P-P2.54-V-F-R2-C5-LS7.1-1: pads 2.00x0.80mm at X=+/-2.95mm, Y pitch 2.54mm. Pin numbering is odd/even across the rows (pin 1 at -X,-Y), matching Conn_02x05_Odd_Even; EasyEDA numbers the same land row-wise. Model is the EasyEDA vendor model with feet at Z=0.")
